        "description": "The pool's own chain (pool:<poolId>), separate from the workspace's: pool_user.* and pool_role.* actions are recorded only there. Only events of the tenant in X-Tenant-Id are returned; another tenant's pool gives an empty list (the gateway checks the pool exists first).",
